        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CBN750003ACHSBR, 3 Inch Clearwater Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Clearwater 3 Inch Cabinet Pull is not only beautiful and interesting as a cabinet door handle, it can also be installed on furniture as a pull. It is made from high quality, hand chiseled acrylic and the mounts are made from brass. It comes packaged with thru-bolt mounting for a 3/4 inch thick door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CBN04-specifications.gif?v=1704354594\" width=\"464\" height=\"217\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FII-CBN750003ACHSBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Clearwater Hand Chiseled Acrylic Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: .63\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CBN04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262332\"><b>First Impressions CBN750003ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
