                "description": "The Clearwater 3 Inch Cabinet Pull is not only beautiful and interesting as a cabinet door handle, it can also be installed on furniture as a pull. It is made from high quality, hand chiseled acrylic and the mounts are made from brass. It comes packaged with thru-bolt mounting for a 3/4 inch thick door.",
